WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:14,070
How do you stay close to the Lord when things are going bad?

00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:22,070
Well, to me, I think it's a whole lot easier for me to stay close to the Lord

00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,070
when things are going bad.

00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:36,070
My flesh is such that when things are going good, you tend to not need God as much.

00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:43,070
I think the whole purpose of God allowing trials in your life is evidence

00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:50,070
that He loves us so much that He gives us trials so that we will have a greater dependence upon Him.

00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:59,070
It's when we do things in our own flesh and our own strength and our own self-ambition

00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:10,070
that we lose track of what is real important in life and we can lose track of our relationship with Him.

00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:18,070
It's on the mountains that is the most dangerous, it's in the valleys that we hang on tighter to the Lord.

00:01:18,070 --> 00:01:28,070
So my advice to someone going through difficult times is to allow it to drive you to a closer relationship with Him.

00:01:28,070 --> 00:01:34,070
Allow it to drive you to a greater level of dependence upon Him.

00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:43,070
Climb up on His lap and just allow Him to snuggle with you and tell you how much He loves you and experience that.

00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:49,070
He walks through those valleys with you and that's what you can at least for me.

00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:56,070
That's what I can tell where my relationship is the strongest is when I'm in those valleys

00:01:56,070 --> 00:02:03,070
that's where I'm the most thankful. It's ever fun, it's ever easy, I'm not a masochist or a sadist,

00:02:03,070 --> 00:02:08,070
but it is through the valleys that it's through the difficult times.

00:02:08,070 --> 00:02:14,070
My wife and I have always sought out difficult times to make ourselves too comfortable.

00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:21,070
When we're too comfortable, we have to go, okay, what is it the Lord wants us to do?

00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:25,070
I think the devil wants us to be the most comfortable.

00:02:25,070 --> 00:02:28,070
Look, what else is the Lord has for us?

00:02:28,070 --> 00:02:35,070
Then I need to get on my knees and get in a prayer time for other people.

00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:42,070
And it's the valleys that remind me of that. So that's where I'm the most encouraged.

